'''Glacite Mineshafts''' are instanced locations that can be accessed by mining in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}.

==Spawning==
'''Glacite Mineshafts''' can be accessed by breaking blocks in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}. The base chance of spawning a '''Glacite Mineshaft''' is {{Chance|0.05%|1|2000}}: this chance can be increased with the '''{{Aqua|Surveryor}}''' perk in the [[Heart of the Mountain|{{DarkPurple|Heart of the Mountain}}]] at {{Dark Purple|Tier 8}}.

'''Glacite Mineshafts''' are covered by [[Pity and RNG Meters#Pity|{{Pink|Pity}}]]:
*The counter starts from {{Green|2,000}}, decreasing according to the {{gold|Block Quality}} of the block mined. Once the counter reaches {{green|0}}, the next block is guaranteed to spawn a '''Glacite Mineshaft''' portal.
*If a block is mined from {{stat|Mining Spread}} or [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|{{AbilityName|Pickobolus}}]], its {{gold|Block Quality}} is {{red|halved}}.
**For example, if a player with {{stat|300 Mining Spread|}} mines a [[File:Packed Ice.png|21px|link=]] [[Glacite]] block, {{green|3}} nearby ones will be indirectly mined. <br>In total, the counter decreases by {{gold|10}}: once by {{gold|4}} and thrice by {{gold|2}}.
*The counter determines the chance of a [[Glacite Mineshaft]] portal spawning on the next block mined: it is the inverse of the counter. 
*{{red|'''However'''}}, on the tab list and in the {{pink|Pity}} menu, the counter appears as starting from {{green|0}}, increasing to {{green|2000}} in contrary to the mechanics initially explained on its introduction<ref>See [[Changelog/2024/April 24]]</ref>
**For example, if the in-game {{Pink|Pity}} counter appears at {{green|859}}, the actual value is {{green|2000-859}}={{green|1141}}. Thus, the probability of spawning a [[Glacite Mineshaft]] portal on the next block is {{chance|0,088%|1|1141}}.
**For example, if the in-game {{Pink|Pity}} counter appears at {{green|1995}}, the actual value is {{green|2000-1995}}={{green|5}}. Thus, the probability of spawning a [[Glacite Mineshaft]] portal on the next block is {{chance|20%|1|5}}.

