== Events ==
A '''Glacite Mineshaft''' has a chance of activating a random mining event. This event lasts until all players have evacuated the mineshaft. The possible events are the following:    
*[[2x Powder]]
*[[Better Together]]
*[[Fortunate Freezing]]

== Corpses ==
{{Main|Frozen Corpses}}
'''Frozen Corpses''' can spawn in any '''Glacite Mineshaft'''. Depending on the size, {{Green|1-3}} corpses will spawn: an additional '''Frozen Corpse''' can spawn in with [[Heart of the Mountain#Dead Man's Chest|Dead Man's Chest]] (+0.5-25%) and [[Frozen Corpses#Frozen Corpse Milestone|Frozen Corpse Milestones]] 2 and 5 (+10-20%), raising the maximum number of corpses up to {{Green|4}}.

