== Gemstone Crystals ==
Rarely a mineshaft may contain a [[Gemstone Crystal]] which is used to forge Perfect [[Gemstones]], it can be one of the following: {{Item|Ruby Crystal}}, {{Item|Jasper Crystal}}, {{Item|Opal Crystal}}, {{Item|Onyx Crystal}}, {{Item|Aquamarine Crystal}}, {{Item|Citrine Crystal}} or {{Item|Peridot Crystal}}. Only the shaft's owner can collect the crystal.

== Leaving Bonus ==
Leaving a '''Glacite Mineshaft''' either through its entrance or with the  {{Item|Ascension Rope}} grants additional {{Item|Glacite Powder}}.

* {{Item|Glacite Powder|amount=1000}} as a base reward
* {{Item|Glacite Powder|amount=500}} per {{Item|Suspicious Scrap}} found
* {{Item|Glacite Powder|amount=250}} per [[Frozen Corpses|Frozen Corpse]] looted
* {{Item|Glacite Powder|amount=10}} per {{stat|Cold}} endured 

Clicking on the floating text at the Entrance will show a list of these bonuses.

