== Tips ==
*The easiest way to leave a Mineshaft is by using an {{Item|Ascension Rope}}.
*Most teleportation and movement abilities are disabled in '''Glacite Mineshafts''', though the {{Item|Grappling Hook}}, {{Item|Leaping Sword}}, and {{Item|Silk-Edge Sword}} function normally.

==Trivia== 
*If the player dies while in a '''Glacite Mineshaft''' through any means such as {{Stat|Cold}} or mobs, they return to the {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}} and are unable to re-enter.

